  g. Bundle the Work with installers, mod packs, or other
     distributions intended for third-party consumption.


3. Permission requests
----------------------

All permission requests must be submitted in writing to KNAPPE0
through the official GitHub repository for this Work:

    https://github.com/KNAPPE0

Requests should clearly describe:

  - The intended use, scope, and audience
  - Whether the use is commercial or non-commercial
  - Whether modifications are proposed and, if so, their nature
  - The party requesting permission and how they may be contacted

A grant of permission, if given, is non-transferable, may be revoked,
may be conditioned on additional terms, and applies only to the
specific use described in the request. Silence does not constitute
permission.


